{
  "name": "Tip of the Spear",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you finish a Short or Long Rest, you can select any number of allied creatures you can see within 30 feet of you. Until the end of your next Short or Long Rest, you and all allied creatures within 5 feet of you automatically succeed on all saving throws against the chosen creatures' spells, and you take no damage if you would normally take half damage on a successful save.</p>",
